      "q": "How much does Palantir Technologies make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Palantir Technologies has $370M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Palantir Technologies won 91 awards this fiscal year and the average award size is $4.1M. Palantir Technologies obligations are up 33.9% year over year."
