    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Palantir Technologies?",
      "a": "Department of Homeland Security, Department of Agriculture, and Department of Veterans Affairs are the largest buyers of Palantir Technologies in FY2026 to date. Department of Homeland Security obligated $162M, Department of Agriculture obligated $129M, and Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $22.9M. Other buying agencies include Department of Transportation with $15.2M and Department of Health and Human Services with $10.8M."
    },
